      "start_line": 121,
      "end_line": 121,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 122,
      "end_line": 122,
      "raw": "If only the .NET 9 runtime is present in `/Users/ymy/.dotnet` and the existing `net8.0` app host exits with exit code 150, rebuild using the Rider bundle SDK. The rebuilt `runtimeconfig.json` includes `rollForward: Major`, making local execution possible on .NET 9 hosts as well.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000070",
      "kind": "blank",
